{"slug":"ROCKS-ALPHA-Money-Farm-15372","_id":"668ac230a53b21a8130fca2f","title":"Money Farm","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c78121","gameId":14908831169,"name":"ROCKS [ALPHA]","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":14908831169},"features":"To start farming you need to throw any rock at the rock collector\n\nI didn't steal the script from the Tora, that's a coincidence. I recently came across this game myself and decided to make a script. I couldn't steal the script from Tora because his code is obfuscate, and mine is source\n\nSolara does not support hookmetamethod","tags":["farm","rock","money","infinite"],"script":"getgenv().farm = not getgenv().farm -- Run the script again to disable autofarm\nlocal collect = game:GetService(\"ReplicatedStorage\"):WaitForChild(\"Remotes\"):WaitForChild(\"RockCollect\")\nlocal arg1\nlocal arg2\n\nlocal namecall\nnamecall = hookmetamethod(game, \"__namecall\", function (self, ...)\n    local method = getnamecallmethod()\n    local args = {...}\n\n    if self == collect and method == \"FireServer\" then\n        arg1 = args[1]\n        arg2 = args[2]\n    end\n\n    return namecall(self, ...)\nend)\n\nwhile getgenv().farm do\n    if arg1 and arg2 then\n        collect:FireServer(arg1, arg2)\n    end\n    wait(0.1)\nend","owner":{"_id":"61f96cc63ede52bf4f7e299d","username":"Bac0nH1ckOff","verified":true,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/4c296a9201f9551996a357d62ae1913747bd75c28208290884e9e394f442f870.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/61f96cc63ede52bf4f7e299d-1697219756847.png"},"lvl":24,"status":"offline","id":"61f96cc63ede52bf4f7e299d","leaderboard":{"tag":{"kind":"hall","rank":1,"period":"all","metric":"views","value":17479725}},"topMilestone":{"key":"creator.likes","tier":1000},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/4c296a9201f9551996a357d62ae1913747bd75c28208290884e9e394f4